<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy & enquiries</span><h1>Know what happens to your information.</h1><p>This draft website lets you prepare a project enquiry without submitting it to the company.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container faq"><h2>Enquiry details</h2><p>The enquiry form stores your entries in your browser’s session storage so you can review them on the next page. The site has no enquiry server connected and does not send these entries to Aveniq.</p><h2>Your downloaded brief</h2><p>If you choose to download the brief, a text file is created on your device. Avoid including passwords, confidential customer data, or other information that is unnecessary for an initial project discussion.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>A complete privacy notice, company contact information, and enquiry delivery arrangements will be added when the business details are confirmed.</p><a class="button outline" href="/contact">Back to Contact Us →</a></div></section>